# DR_EVT Python Bindings

The Python package provides in-process access to DR_EVT batch and streaming
simulation.

Build instructions, supported parameters, methods, examples, and limitations
are maintained in the [Python API documentation](../docs/api/PYTHON_API.md).

The runnable streaming example is `example_streaming.py`; binding definitions
are in `dr_evt_bindings.cpp`.
